00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:16.140
Well, we got to trade messages with the writers of this episode, Warren Lieberstein and Halstead Sullivan,
我们和本集的编剧沃伦·利伯斯坦以及霍尔斯特德·沙利文交流过，

76
00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.740
